elong in `NON_COVERAGE`: false prose that ships alongside a claim revision, which the ticket concedes and this design does not fix; a paragraph that cites nothing, which has no edge to compare against; a citation added to a claim not yet in proof, which cannot be listed until some pass proves that claim and by then the first proof postdates the edit; whether the two clocks behind the ordering agree; and whether the prose is wrong at all, which nothing here judges. | OWED |
