es (render_targets in compose.rs, census re-verification in checks.rs, NON_COVERAGE in report.rs) are each present to be extended. Nothing in the design's surface parses a language or re-runs anything at check time, matching the shipped checker's read-only discipline.\",\"pin\":\"sha256:fcb29de8f5e1dc599b68af103453b2dca2ffe1fa1a02529382e1930ad9e4d215\",\"timestamp\":1786174515}}\n36:{\"_type\":\"https://in-toto.io/Statement/v1\",\"subject\":[{\"name\":\"C7\",\"digest\":{\"sha256\":\"f9f29efaca0a411f83b5cf51afde3bc6c8d1deadfea520da4f00c6efdac50081\"}}],\"predicateType\":\"https://github.com/lonic-software/tetel/captured-fact/v1\",\"predicate\":{\"verdict\":\"supports\",\"pass\":\"c7ccb4bc34bdb0bf\",\"reported_kind\":\"run\",\"source\":\"proc:workspace-c7ccb4bc34bdb0bf\",\"extent\":[\"/Volumes/SSD/Documents/lonic/tetel/src/facts.rs\",\"/Volumes/SSD/Documents/lonic/tetel/src/observe.rs\"],\"world\":[{\"root\":\"/Volumes/SSD/Documents/lonic/tetel\",\"state\":\"git:5076b5fe177f2ab87259d8d1e36881c055e0be35001992b01789e8ac000461a8\"}],\"note\":\"The load-bearing edge case is code, and it is there: ExtentEntry::censuses() matches Some(Search) | Some(NoMatch), and its doc states verbatim \\\"a symbol with no occurrences is censused by the grep that established it has none\\\" — so a green-field destination symbol is declarable as a target today, which is what makes \\\"destination must be a live target\\\" compose without cost. The what-the-tool-cannot-verify disposition matches the shipped NON_COVERAGE practice.\",\"pin\":\"sha256:b1fe665d52d35773b5e826ab2fed437a5d12e9509486a309725ae3e5f041726b\",\"timestamp\":1786175408}}\n39:{\"_type\":\"https://in-toto.io/Statement/v1\",\"subject\":[{\"name\":\"C9\",\"digest\":{\"sha256\":\"cb5341da6e2f682d09430555d1dc4e3951715d527f192b33d43a869e30c1e1ee\"}}],\"predicateType\":\"https://github.com/lonic-software/tetel/captured-fact/v1\",\"predicate\":{\"verdict\":\"supports\",\"pass\":\"c7ccb4bc34bdb0bf\",\"reported_kind\":\"run\",\"sour